{
  "id": "PHP.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "PHP",
  "reference": "Philippians 1",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul and Timothy, servants of Christ Jesus, to all the saints in Christ Jesus that are at Philippi, with the bishops and deacons: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thank my God upon all my remembrance of you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "always in every supplication of mine on behalf of you all making my supplication with joy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for your fellowship in furtherance of the gospel from the first day until now; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "being confident of this very thing, that he who began a good work in you will perfect it until the day of Jesus Christ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even as it is right for me to be thus minded on behalf of you all, because I have you in my heart, inasmuch as, both in my bonds and in the defence and confirmation of the gospel, ye all are partakers with me of grace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For God is my witness, how I long after you all in the tender mercies of Christ Jesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this I pray, that your love may abound yet more and more in knowledge and all discernment; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that ye may approve the things that are excellent; that ye may be sincere and void of offence unto the day of Christ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "being filled with the fruits of righteousness, which are through Jesus Christ, unto the glory and praise of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I would have you know, brethren, that the things ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto me have fallen out rather unto the progress of the gospel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that my bonds became manifest in Christ throughout the whole prætorian guard, and to all the rest; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and that most of the brethren in the Lord, being confident through my bonds, are more abundantly bold to speak the word of God without fear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some indeed preach Christ even of envy and strife; and some also of good will: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the one ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of love, knowing that I am set for the defence of the gospel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the other proclaim Christ of faction, not sincerely, thinking to raise up affliction for me in my bonds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What then? only that in every way, whether in pretence or in truth, Christ is proclaimed; and therein I rejoice, yea, and will rejoice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I know that this shall turn out to my salvation, through your supplication and the supply of the Spirit of Jesus Christ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to my earnest expectation and hope, that in nothing shall I be put to shame, but ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with all boldness, as always, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " now also Christ shall be magnified in my body, whether by life, or by death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For to me to live is Christ, and to die is gain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if to live in the flesh,—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " this shall bring fruit from my work, then what I shall choose I know not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I am in a strait betwixt the two, having the desire to depart and be with Christ; for it is very far better: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet to abide in the flesh is more needful for your sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And having this confidence, I know that I shall abide, yea, and abide with you all, for your progress and joy in the faith; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that your glorying may abound in Christ Jesus in me through my presence with you again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only let your manner of life be worthy of the gospel of Christ: that, whether I come and see you or be absent, I may hear of your state, that ye stand fast in one spirit, with one soul striving for the faith of the gospel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and in nothing affrighted by the adversaries: which is for them an evident token of perdition, but of your salvation, and that from God; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because to you it hath been granted in the behalf of Christ, not only to believe on him, but also to suffer in his behalf: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "having the same conflict which ye saw in me, and now hear to be in me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PHP.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "PHP"
  },
